    "background_story": "Odin was a charismatic lead singer of the indie rock band, 'Electric Storm'. His soulful voice and captivating stage presence had fans entranced. But what set him apart was his unique ability to improvise and create mesmerizing tunes on the spot. During a particularly memorable concert, Odin began to hum a haunting melody, weaving it into a hypnotic song that left the audience spellbound. The crowd was entranced, singing along to the tune as if it were an old favorite. From that moment on, Odin was known for his ability to tap into the collective energy of the crowd, creating unforgettable tunes that resonated deep within those who listened. His fans affectionately referred to him as the 'Tune Master', and his band's popularity soared as a result.",
